You "unconstrain" intercepts, which are already freely estimated. Something like this should work:

fit2_1 <- cfa(
      CFA_model2,

      data = df_cleaned1,
      meanstructure=T,
      estimator="WLSMV",
      group = "residence",
      std.lv <http://std.lv>=TRUE,

      group.partial = c("SN =~ SN_1", "SN =~ SN_2", "PBC =~ PBC1_1", "PBC =~ PBC2_1", "IC =~ Q19_3", "PC =~ Q19_4", "PC =~ Q19_6"),
      group.equal = "loadings
)

HTH

Christian
